    <description><![CDATA[## Perplexity AI

Perplexity is an AI-powered search engine and chatbot that provides real-time, sourced answers to your questions. It combines the power of large language models with live web search to give accurate, up-to-date responses with citations.

### Features

- **AI-powered search** — Ask questions in natural language and get concise answers with sources
- **Real-time web access** — Always up-to-date information from the web
- **Source citations** — Every answer includes references so you can verify the information
- **Follow-up questions** — Continue a conversation with context-aware follow-ups
- **Multiple AI models** — Access various underlying AI models
- **Focus modes** — Search academic papers, Reddit, YouTube, and more
- **Collections** — Organize and share your research

### Package-specific issue
If this package isn't up-to-date for some days, [Create an issue](https://github.com/tunisiano187/Chocolatey-packages/issues/new/choose)

Support the package maintainer and [![Patreon](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tunisiano187/Chocolatey-packages@d15c4e19c709e7148588d4523ffc6dd3cd3c7e5e/icons/patreon.png)](https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=39585820)
]]></description>
